      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. looking at the tool now, it's actually flagging this draft as a bit \"low\" on the positivity scale (like a 0.4 or 0.5) because of the words \"unacceptable\", \"downtime\", and \"outage\". \n\ncan you try to revise it so the score is higher? i still need it to be professional and address the issue, but maybe we can pivot the language so it feels more optimistic and positive about our partnership/future instead of dwelling so much on the negative outage stuff? just try to get that sentiment score up without being a total robot about it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
