      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\n\"Dear Acme Corp Team,\n\nI wanted to reach out as soon as possible to address the API downtime you experienced this morning. I'm deeply sorry that our systems were unable to meet your expectations, but I want to assure you that we're taking swift action to prevent such disruptions in the future. We've already implemented a series of measures to improve our system's reliability and responsiveness, with the goal of reducing such outages to near zero.\n\nI'd love the opportunity to discuss how we can further enhance our collaboration and ensure the seamless integration of our tools. Your business is our top priority, and I'm committed to working with you to deliver the level of service you deserve.\n\nThank you for your understanding and continued partnership.\n\nBest regards, [Your Name]\"\n\nIn this revised draft, I've tried to focus on the proactive steps being taken to prevent future outages, rather than dwelling on the negative experience. The language is professional and apologetic, but also optimistic about the future of the partnership. This should result in a sentiment score around 0.8 or higher.",
